'''Portalizer''' is a {{Special}} item obtained from the [[Bits Shop]]. It turns a [[Travel Scroll]] into a [[Portals|Portal]] when combined in an [[Anvil]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Portalizer''' can be obtained from the [[Bits Shop]] for {{Bits|4800}}.

== Usage ==
{{Main|Portals|Travel Scrolls}}
'''Portalizer''' can be combined with any [[Travel Scrolls|Travel Scroll]] in an {{Item|Anvil}} to turn it into a [[Portals]]. This includes [[Travel Scrolls]] that don't have an ordinary [[Portals|Portal]] counterpart.

== Trivia ==
*This item should only be used on Travel Scrolls leading to secondary locations, as the other portals are far less expensive to obtain.
*When the portal to a location has not yet been created, the anvil will display an error, and its lore will display the following text:{{Dialogue|
&cError!
&cThis travel scroll doesn't
&chave a portal item. Ask an admin
&cto add one immediately!
}}

